  "body": "Advanced.\n【Revelation】 - Put Hospital Debts into play in your threat area, with 3 resources on it as debt. It cannot leave play while it has 1 or more resources on it.\n【Forced】 - When you would play a card: Increase the cost of that card by 2 and remove 1 resource from Hospital Debts. Then, if Hospital Debts has no resources on it, discard it.\n",
